Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:16:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent backend command routing so slash
 commands stay raw

Selected-agent chat text that begins with a slash is a provider command, not an ordinary prompt. The backend contract exposes a command execution path and Codex resumes known sessions with the raw command string so commands such as /status and /fork keep their native semantics.
