+When a selected-agent chat message starts with `/` and the first character after the slash is not
+whitespace, `CommandChat` routes it through `AgentBackend::run_command_streaming` instead of
+`AgentBackend::send_streaming`. This keeps provider commands such as `/status` and `/fork` on the
+backend command path while ordinary chat text remains a prompt send.
+
 `CommandChat` uses the active `AgentProfile` when launching user agents, reviewers, and linearizers.
 Workflow code must not hard-code `AgentKind::Codex` when the active profile supplies the provider.
 
